    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67800" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικρ-ύνω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμικρ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belittle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				236
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make small, lessen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.154
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).77
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>write with a short vowel</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμικρυνθέντος τοῦ ο̄</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					68.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Zonar.
			</span></i> s.v.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρον</span>.</div>
